# Gyoza Maison — v1.2.1

*August 19, 2026*

CI/CD only: releases can now be cut with a single `git push` of a version tag.

## CI/CD

- `build-and-push.yml` now also triggers on pushing a `v*` tag (`git tag vX.Y.Z && git push origin vX.Y.Z`), running the full pipeline — tests, image build, e2e, tag confirmation, GitHub release — under that exact version.
- Previously an official (non-prerelease) version needed a separate manual `workflow_dispatch` run after the tag existed; that manual path still works (useful for `retag_from`), but is no longer required for the common case.
